        <detaileddescription>
<para>Initialize a rectangle draw descriptor from an object&apos;s styles in its current state <parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>obj</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
